// The rule itself: intensional include, expandable only on a terminology server that
// holds the LOINC Ontology release named by the alias
* include codes from system $sct-loinc-ontology where constraint = "<< 363787002 |Observable entity (observable entity)| : 370130000 |Property (attribute)| = (118589004 |Threshold (property) (qualifier value)| OR 705057003 |Presence (property) (qualifier value)|), 370132008 |Scale type (attribute)| = 117363000 |Ordinal value (qualifier value)|, 246501002 |Technique (attribute)| = (<< 278289002 |Microscopy technique (qualifier value)| OR << 703857004 |Staining technique (qualifier value)|)"
